# SUC 2.0 (TreeTagger)
#
# Stockholm Umeå Corpus POS Tags as emitted by the TreeTagger Swedish model.
# In contrast to sv-suc-pos.map (which lists only the bare SUC word classes),
# the TreeTagger model emits the full morphological tag (e.g. NN.utr.sin.def.nom),
# so every tag is enumerated here. The coarse part-of-speech is determined by the
# SUC word class in the head of the tag (the part before the first '.').
#
# Source: extracted from the TreeTagger model using TT4J
__META_SOURCE_URL__=http\://spraakbanken.gu.se/parole/Docs/SUC2.0-manual.pdf
__META_TYPE_BASE__=de.tudarmstadt.ukp.dkpro.core.api.lexmorph.type.pos.

